# Work lanes

Before you edit gameplay, UI, or card data, read `design/LANES.md`.

It says which files each lane owns (UI / Core / Content), which files are shared, and how to pick a file for a new task.

`scripts/main.gd` is only boot, frame, and input. Put new work in `scripts/ui/`, `scripts/core/`, `scripts/content/`, or the existing scene scripts that lane already owns.

Shared files (`scripts/lanes/game_state.gd`, `scripts/main.gd`) are one lane at a time and the smallest edit.

Do not rewrite locked player-copy or board text. `data/player-copy.json` stays Jam’s file.
